{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BENEATH JERUSALEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Dungeon Crawling:</strong> Explore a claustrophobic, atmospheric world based on the real-world ruins and secret passages hidden beneath the Holy City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.poster.avif?t=1771245099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.webm?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.mp4?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANGEROUS DUNGEONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Auri Mortui:</strong> Face the &quot;Gilded Dead&quot;, previous scavengers who were consumed by their obsession. They entered these tunnels for gold and never left; now, they wander the dark as hollow husks, protecting their hoard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.poster.avif?t=1771245099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.webm?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.mp4?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold is your only leverage. Every coin you find must be brought back to the surface to pay your way. <strong>Manage your resources wisely</strong> to buy the gear and supplies needed for your next descent into the deep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.poster.avif?t=1771245099\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.webm?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.mp4?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic History: THE DUNGEONPEDIA</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and explore the DungeonPedia, a comprehensive encyclopedia featuring history professor Peter. Unlock custom videos for every achievement you earn to learn the true stories behind the ruins and artifacts you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.poster.avif?t=1771245099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.webm?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.mp4?t=1771245099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>